%U A399455 11907528289436183536,691929860397451966529,42938420024335350010158,2834201018599387332001813,198276986992619400370572780
%N A399455 Total number of edge covers in all labeled trees on n vertices.
%H A399455 Andrew Howroyd, <a href="/A399455/b399455.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..300</a>
%H A399455 Eric Weisstein's World of Mathematics, <a href="https://mathworld.wolfram.com/EdgeCover.html">Edge Cover</a>.
%o A399455 (PARI) seq(n)={my(u=v=O(x)); for(n=1, n, my(t=x*exp(v)); v=t*(exp(u+v)-1); u=t); Vec(serlaplace(intformal(v/x)), -n)}
%Y A399455 Cf. A399452, A399453, A401090.
%K A399455 nonn
%O A399455 1,3
